Revision history for Perl-Critic-Distribution

0.003 2026-11-26 TEODESIAN
    - root_of places a module in blib/lib in lib/ of its distribution, so a policy that reads the distribution sees it during the tests of a build
    - The POD of each method says what it returns, and how it dies

0.002 2026-10-22 TEODESIAN
    - for_file takes cache, and policy_parameters gives a policy the cache
      and cache_dir parameters that it passes on.
    - called_by_perl lists the subs that perl or a framework calls by name.
    - walk visits a document with the package and the sub of each element.

0.001 2026-10-08 TEODESIAN
    - Initial Release
